em. \n\nCoordinate with friends to man massive multicrew spaceships featuring fully detailed interiors ranging from humble shuttles to gargantuan space battle ships and aircraft carriers. \n\nMaster physics-based space combat in space fighter jet dogfights or massive warship battles. \n\nGraphics level 9-10 recommended. Private server owners can use commands ('@commands' to list) and admin ships in their private servers but do not earn any exp. ","path":"/game/5747806266-starbase","slug":"5747806266-starbase","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1c11a12198c58733c7d427534daad7a62c55b5076352f0ea47512af7bbfe0a84.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ef8641cc25c258c6f09862b90fe70f4c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":103,"visitor":22574298,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-03-01T03:07:44.307Z","creator":{"name":"Astrabasis Interactive Media","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2653064683,"name":"Word Bomb","desc":"💣 Inspired by BombParty on JKLM!\n👋 A major update to Word Bomb is coming soon. Enable notifications and follow the group for more details.\n\n📚 COMMANDS\nTo see a list of all commands, visit this link:\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/commands/3025377\n\n🙂 Please do not be mad at others for helping people or using Google, learning is encouraged, and it is NOT cheating!\n\n🎮 It's a pass-it-on bomb game! Type words containing specific letters to pass the bomb on to somebody else.\nThe bomb ticks faster and faster the longer a round goes on. The last man standing wins!\n\n👍 Good for learning new words, quick typing skills, reaction time, and for obtaining very high IQ.","path":"/game/2653064683-word-bomb","slug":"2653064683-word-bomb","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/563ac1a4543caaf9c76da305581aa818d7d0bc815c8b4eca87fc13172d1a010e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-24635c5bfa0499734f3216bc042f61e3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":103,"visitor":108693399,"verified